Z||000006||Monkeyman||10-16-2000||04:41 AM||||The more I think about this, the more I don't understand why any airbags of the proper size wouldn't work.  I know about airbags on a truck, but have never seen any up close on a car (or pickup).  You basically replace the spring with the airbag, right?  What's the problem?  As long as the bag fits and doesn't have a significantly larger diameter, I don't see why it couldn't be done.  Although, for $1500, I can get some mighty nice coilovers for both ends. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
